question_rules.template:
{% set mc = month_context(question, vnb_monthly) %}
{% set tgt = mc[0] if mc[0] else vnb_monthly[-1].month %}
{% set row = (vnb_monthly|selectattr('month','equalto',tgt)|list)[0] %}
{% set ch = filter_by_month(channel_monthly, tgt) %}
**VNB in {{ month_label(tgt) }}: {{ row.total_vnb|money }} on {{ row.total_ape|money }} APE (margin {{ row.total_margin|pct }}).**

| Channel | Active agents | Avg productivity ($k) | APE ($M) | VNB ($M) | VNB margin |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for c in ch %}| {{ c.channel_name }} | {{ "%d"|format(c.active) }} | {{ "%.2f"|format(c.avg_prod) }} | {{ "%.3f"|format(c.ape) }} | {{ "%.3f"|format(c.vnb) }} | {{ c.margin|pct }} |
{% endfor %}

{% set a = attr_for(question) %}
{% if a %}
**{{ a.label }} vs {{ a.prev_label }}:** total VNB {{ a.prev_total_vnb|money }} to {{ a.cur_total_vnb|money }} (change {{ a.delta_total_vnb|money }}).

| Driver | Effect on VNB |
|---|---|
| Active-agent effect | {{ a.factors.agent_effect|money }} |
| Productivity effect | {{ a.factors.productivity_effect|money }} |
| Mix / margin effect | {{ a.factors.mix_effect|money }} |
| **Total** | **{{ a.factors.delta_vnb|money }}** |
| *Reconciliation residual* | {{ (a.factors.delta_vnb - a.factors.agent_effect - a.factors.productivity_effect - a.factors.mix_effect)|money }} |
{% else %}
No month-on-month pair is available for the month you asked about.
{% endif %}

{% set a = attr_for(question) %}
{% if a %}
**Driver attribution — {{ a.label }} versus {{ a.prev_label }}.** Total VNB {{ a.prev_total_vnb|money }} to {{ a.cur_total_vnb|money }} ({{ a.delta_total_vnb|money }}).
The ontology identity **VNB = Active agents × Avg productivity × VNB margin** is applied per channel, so the three effects add up exactly to the movement (no unexplained residual).

| Channel | Active-agent effect | Productivity effect | Mix / margin effect | Total change |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for c in a.channels %}| {{ c.channel_name }} | {{ c.agent_effect|money }} | {{ c.productivity_effect|money }} | {{ c.mix_effect|money }} | {{ c.delta_vnb|money }} |
{% endfor %}| **All channels** | **{{ a.factors.agent_effect|money }}** | **{{ a.factors.productivity_effect|money }}** | **{{ a.factors.mix_effect|money }}** | **{{ a.factors.delta_vnb|money }}** |
{% else %}
No month-on-month pair is available for the month you asked about.
{% endif %}

{% set mc = month_context(question, vnb_monthly) %}
{% set tgt = mc[0] if mc[0] else vnb_monthly[-1].month %}
{% set ch = filter_by_month(channel_monthly, tgt) %}
{% set row = (vnb_monthly|selectattr('month','equalto',tgt)|list)[0] %}
**Channel contribution to VNB — {{ month_label(tgt) }} (total {{ row.total_vnb|money }}).**

| Channel | VNB ($M) | Share of VNB | Active agents | VNB margin |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for c in ch %}| {{ c.channel_name }} | {{ "%.3f"|format(c.vnb) }} | {{ (c.vnb / row.total_vnb)|pct }} | {{ "%d"|format(c.active) }} | {{ c.margin|pct }} |
{% endfor %}
